<blockquote class="uncited"><div>Hi,<br><br>is OpenGD77 available to MD-9600(GPS) Hardware V1.00?<br><br>Tnx<br>Matthias</div></blockquote>All hardware versions are supported.<br><br>But... Most radios which display V1 in the official firmware are actually hardware PCB version 2.x<br><br>You should try the V2 firmware version first.<br><br>The V1 firmware version is actually for the first V2 PCB radios. Although the PCB is labelled V2, there are some small differences, so we had to make a V1 firmware version for early V2 hardware versions.<br><br>We are not aware of how to determine if the hardware is old V2 or newer V2. Probably TYT knows this from the serial numbers, but we don't have this information.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Fri Apr 29, 2022 11:33 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
